1
00:00:02,055 --> 00:00:03,975
Last time, in 2010,

2
00:00:03,995 --> 00:00:05,690
Jupiter became a second sun,

3
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:07,495
and a message went out to Earth:

4
00:00:07,515 --> 00:00:10,585
all these worlds are yours, except Europa.

5
00:00:10,605 --> 00:00:13,485
Dave and HAL vanished into the monolith.

6
00:00:13,505 --> 00:00:14,655
There are no more movies,

7
00:00:14,675 --> 00:00:17,080
but Arthur C. Clarke wrote two more

8
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:20,480
books: 2061 and 3001.

9
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,480
Clarke said each book is a variation

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,205
on a theme,

11
00:00:23,225 --> 00:00:25,030
so details shift a little.

12
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:26,480
Here's part three.

13
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,775
Spoilers ahead!

14
00:00:28,445 --> 00:00:30,225
It's 2061.

15
00:00:30,245 --> 00:00:32,050
Heywood Floyd is now a hundred

16
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:33,275
and three years old,

17
00:00:33,295 --> 00:00:36,050
kept healthy by living in low gravity.

18
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:38,825
People call Jupiter's new sun Lucifer,

19
00:00:38,845 --> 00:00:42,025
and Europa is hidden under thick clouds.

20
00:00:42,045 --> 00:00:43,175
Floyd is a guest

21
00:00:43,195 --> 00:00:45,825
on a luxury spaceship called Universe,

22
00:00:45,845 --> 00:00:47,700
headed for Halley's Comet.

23
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:48,375
He becomes one

24
00:00:48,395 --> 00:00:50,025
of the first people ever to walk

25
00:00:50,045 --> 00:00:51,224
on its surface.

26
00:00:51,959 --> 00:00:54,939
Meanwhile, Floyd's grandson Chris is an officer

27
00:00:54,959 --> 00:00:56,903
on another ship, the Galaxy.

28
00:00:56,923 --> 00:00:59,574
A stewardess tries to hijack it

29
00:00:59,594 --> 00:01:01,794
and force it toward Europa.

30
00:01:01,844 --> 00:01:03,509
The plan goes wrong,

31
00:01:03,529 --> 00:01:05,284
and the Galaxy splashes down

32
00:01:05,304 --> 00:01:07,334
in Europa's new ocean.

33
00:01:07,354 --> 00:01:08,934
The crew is stranded,

34
00:01:08,954 --> 00:01:10,659
on the one world humans were warned

35
00:01:10,679 --> 00:01:12,229
to stay away from.

36
00:01:12,349 --> 00:01:14,354
And right nearby is a mountain made

37
00:01:14,374 --> 00:01:15,971
of solid diamond.

38
00:01:16,667 --> 00:01:17,772
The mountain is a piece

39
00:01:17,792 --> 00:01:19,357
of Jupiter's old core,

40
00:01:19,377 --> 00:01:21,807
blasted out when the planet collapsed.

41
00:01:21,827 --> 00:01:24,032
The Universe changes course and rescues

42
00:01:24,052 --> 00:01:25,657
the stranded crew.

43
00:01:25,677 --> 00:01:26,432
Along the way,

44
00:01:26,452 --> 00:01:28,107
they glimpse the Europans,

45
00:01:28,127 --> 00:01:31,077
strange creatures crawling out of the sea.

46
00:01:31,177 --> 00:01:32,807
And Clarke reveals that Dave

47
00:01:32,827 --> 00:01:36,957
and HAL still live inside the monolith, watching.

48
00:01:36,977 --> 00:01:38,682
In about a thousand years,

49
00:01:38,702 --> 00:01:40,250
humans will be judged.

50
00:01:41,007 --> 00:01:43,862
Now jump to the year 3001.

51
00:01:43,882 --> 00:01:44,887
Far out at the edge

52
00:01:44,907 --> 00:01:46,031
of the solar system,

53
00:01:46,051 --> 00:01:47,792
a space tug finds

54
00:01:47,812 --> 00:01:50,367
a frozen body drifting in the dark.

55
00:01:50,387 --> 00:01:51,742
It's Frank Poole,

56
00:01:51,762 --> 00:01:55,507
the astronaut HAL sent spinning into space,

57
00:01:55,527 --> 00:01:57,357
a thousand years earlier.

58
00:01:57,377 --> 00:02:00,107
Future medicine brings him back to life.

59
00:02:00,127 --> 00:02:00,857
Frank wakes up

60
00:02:00,877 --> 00:02:03,120
in a world he barely recognizes.

61
00:02:03,904 --> 00:02:06,234
Earth now has four giant towers

62
00:02:06,254 --> 00:02:08,084
that rise from the equator all

63
00:02:08,104 --> 00:02:09,759
the way up into space,

64
00:02:09,779 --> 00:02:11,809
joined by a ring around the planet

65
00:02:11,829 --> 00:02:13,409
where people live.

66
00:02:13,429 --> 00:02:14,834
Instead of screens,

67
00:02:14,854 --> 00:02:16,859
people wear BrainCaps that connect

68
00:02:16,879 --> 00:02:19,309
their minds straight to computers.

69
00:02:19,329 --> 00:02:22,229
Humans live on the moons of Jupiter.

70
00:02:22,354 --> 00:02:24,084
And everyone wants to meet the man

71
00:02:24,104 --> 00:02:25,980
from the year 2001.

72
00:02:26,662 --> 00:02:28,092
Frank travels to Europa,

73
00:02:28,112 --> 00:02:30,067
and something reaches out to him:

74
00:02:30,087 --> 00:02:32,217
Dave Bowman and HAL,

75
00:02:32,237 --> 00:02:35,392
now merged into one mind, called Halman.

76
00:02:35,412 --> 00:02:37,717
Halman has been inside the monolith all

77
00:02:37,737 --> 00:02:40,222
this time, learning how it works.

78
00:02:40,242 --> 00:02:41,797
And he has a warning.

79
00:02:41,817 --> 00:02:44,022
The monolith is not a god.

80
00:02:44,042 --> 00:02:45,172
It's a machine,

81
00:02:45,192 --> 00:02:46,822
and it's been reporting on humans

82
00:02:46,842 --> 00:02:48,021
to its makers.

83
00:02:48,752 --> 00:02:50,907
Those makers are so far away

84
00:02:50,927 --> 00:02:52,457
that their answer took centuries

85
00:02:52,477 --> 00:02:53,752
to come back.

86
00:02:53,832 --> 00:02:55,312
Now it has arrived,

87
00:02:55,332 --> 00:02:57,087
and it's bad news.

88
00:02:57,107 --> 00:02:58,687
The monolith's new orders

89
00:02:58,707 --> 00:03:00,857
are to wipe out humanity.

90
00:03:00,942 --> 00:03:02,822
The same machine that taught apes

91
00:03:02,842 --> 00:03:06,222
to use tools now plans to end the story.

92
00:03:06,242 --> 00:03:07,997
Humans have very little time

93
00:03:08,017 --> 00:03:09,084
to fight back.

94
00:03:09,841 --> 00:03:11,246
Deep inside a mountain

95
00:03:11,266 --> 00:03:13,121
on the Moon called Pico,

96
00:03:13,141 --> 00:03:14,346
there's a sealed vault

97
00:03:14,366 --> 00:03:17,971
of the most dangerous computer viruses ever made.

98
00:03:17,991 --> 00:03:19,906
Frank's team takes some out,

99
00:03:19,926 --> 00:03:22,331
and Halman carries them into the monolith,

100
00:03:22,351 --> 00:03:24,256
like a Trojan horse.

101
00:03:24,276 --> 00:03:25,856
The plan works.

102
00:03:25,876 --> 00:03:28,246
The virus spreads through the monoliths,

103
00:03:28,266 --> 00:03:29,846
and they shut down for good,

104
00:03:29,866 --> 00:03:31,323
before they can strike.

105
00:03:32,062 --> 00:03:34,067
So that's the whole odyssey.

106
00:03:34,087 --> 00:03:36,837
A monolith taught apes to use tools.

107
00:03:36,927 --> 00:03:38,815
Another called humans to Jupiter.

108
00:03:38,835 --> 00:03:42,092
A third turned Jupiter into a sun.

109
00:03:42,202 --> 00:03:43,032
And in the end,

110
00:03:43,052 --> 00:03:44,757
humans used their own tools

111
00:03:44,777 --> 00:03:46,057
to stop them.

112
00:03:46,077 --> 00:03:47,407
Clarke ends with a hint

113
00:03:47,427 --> 00:03:49,757
that the makers may notice someday.

114
00:03:49,777 --> 00:03:52,364
Until then, the future belongs to us.

